  I ran across the strangest 'bug' while playing the PC standard release of
  Nethack 3.0.10 yesterday...

  I was playing a Valkyrie and was starving to death (a usual occurence when 
  your pet has been polymorphed into a purple worm...).  I was at the fainting
  stage -- forsaken by my God -- and I decided to read one of my spellbooks
  (hoping for 'create monster' or 'detect food') when suddenly I got attacked.
  This, of course, interrupted my reading.  I killed the monster with no 
  trouble (it left no corpse...) and noticed something odd.  My hunger status
  read 'fainted', but I was moving around with no problems.  I was, in fact,
  able to move unhindered for some 150 turns (still found no food, though) 
  before I died of starvation.  I didn't continue reading the book during this
  time because I suspected that I might be able to live until I did so.

  Bug or feature?  Comments?
